message: "If you use this software, the Lutar Invariant family, or the Ouroboros Thesis v9, please cite as below."
title: "Ouroboros Thesis v9 — UNIFIED-OPERATIONAL: The Lutar Invariant Family (v1 → v7 + Ω)"
abstract: >-
  Operational, source-grounded canonical thesis covering the full Lutar
  Invariant family v1..v7 plus the unified master invariant L_Ω, with a
  Bianchi-closed fiber-bundle formulation (HUFT-inspired) and a Holographic-
  Twistor-Cyclic L₆ extension. Every formula is bound to a shipping API
  endpoint, a typed knowledge-graph node (Supreme Knowledge Codex v11:
  75 nodes, 94 edges, 43 sourced, 19 formula), guardrails contract tests,
  and an A11oy surface (/thesis).
